      "applicability": "iframe elements included in the accessibility tree, also inside open shadow roots: not display:none, not aria-hidden, not role=none/presentation.",
      "expectation": "Fails for every applicable iframe whose accessible name is empty: no title, an\nempty title, no aria-label or aria-labelledby. A name from title or aria-label\npasses. Frames that are hidden (display:none, aria-hidden) or presentational\nare not exposed as frames and do not apply. One finding per frame, at the\niframe.",
